{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>TapPlus</i> is a minimalist clicker game where all you need to do is press a button and watch the number go up. No complex systems or distractions\u2014just the pure satisfaction of seeing that &quot;+1&quot; climb.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Killing time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of number-growing satisfaction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players looking for a calm and simple experience</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One-click gameplay, instantly accessible</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean, minimalistic interface</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam leaderboard support to compete with players worldwide</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're here for a quick session or aiming for the top, <i>TapPlus</i> is always ready.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3770740?t=1763724975","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3770740?t=1763724975","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770740/e75f17bb735a9393547db74b0e1ebce604de7dcb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763724975","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3770740/e75f17bb735a9393547db74b0e1ebce604de7dcb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763724975","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>TapPlus</i> is a minimalist clicker game where all you need to do is press a button and watch the number go up. No complex systems or distractions\u2014just the pure satisfaction of seeing that &quot;+1&quot; climb.</p>